  "conversion": {
    "birds": "Sum original Game.snapshot active Attack+Health after auras, before Start of Combat. Eggs and the Lump's borrowed Nest stats are already included. The printed board total already excludes sky/away and hand bodies; do not add or subtract the separately printed sky.",
    "fairies": "Use original snapshot recruit total (rec), not combat (comb): this retains the printed Fetch body and occupied-slot Rings, removes the Start-of-Combat Fetch replacement/twin and Wisps on empty Ring slots. Per-round removed_start_effect_stats is comb minus rec. Built Fetch share 0.5 replaces authored default 1.0, though it changes only combat, not rec."
  },
